=== doorway ===
# AUDIOLOOP rain.wav
Rain drums on the roof as you reach the old cottage. # IMAGE door.svg
The door is open a crack, and warm light spills out into the dark.

* [Knock] -> knock
* [Push the door open] -> inside

=== knock ===
You knock twice. # AUDIO chime.wav
Somewhere inside, a small bell answers.
-> inside

=== inside ===
You step in out of the rain, and the door swings shut behind you. # AUDIOSTOP: loop
A fire crackles in the grate. Someone has been expecting you.

